{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Descend into the depths of madness and terror in this disturbing pixel-art graphic adventure\u2014a simultaneous prequel and sequel to Vlad Circus: Descend into Madness (2022). Vlad Circus: Curse of Asmodeus draws you into a world of mirrors and shadows where evil lurks in every corner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a haunting universe through the eyes of Josef Petrescu, a man scarred by tragedy who awakens horribly burned, voiceless, and memoryless. As Vlad Petrescu\u2019s brother and co-heir to Vlad Circus, Josef embarks on a harrowing journey to uncover the truth behind his past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1567530/extras/1a2f8b5928a02500dc8d62684f716d1e.poster.avif?t=1756160890\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1567530/extras/1a2f8b5928a02500dc8d62684f716d1e.webm?t=1756160890\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1567530/extras/1a2f8b5928a02500dc8d62684f716d1e.mp4?t=1756160890\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Innovative Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vlad Circus: Curse of Asmodeus pushes horror game storytelling forward with its unique mechanics of navigating parallel timelines. Pass through mirrors to shift between fragmented memories. Each temporal jump uncovers new layers of the story, allowing you to piece together Josef\u2019s life and the macabre secret hidden in the old town of San Reno. Interact with a chilling array of characters\u2014from the bizarre inhabitants of the dime museum to the terrifying dwellers of the catacombs. Each encounter will bring you closer to the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you dive deeper into the story, you\u2019ll face challenges that test both your wits and survival skills, presented in small doses of action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1567530/extras/b543f41d9314a7b072951a6b2b0afaa8.poster.avif?t=1756160890\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1567530/extras/b543f41d9314a7b072951a6b2b0afaa8.webm?t=1756160890\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1567530/extras/b543f41d9314a7b072951a6b2b0afaa8.mp4?t=1756160890\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An Immersive Narrative</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the heart of this nightmare lies Asmodeus, the biblical demon reimagined as an infernal parasite feeding on human sanity. The only way to purge the demon is through fire, torture, and the agonizing death of the body it inhabits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Josef recovers fragments of his memory, he documents them in his journal, weaving an intricate narrative that keeps you in suspense until the end. Each journal entry is another piece of the puzzle, drawing you closer to the truth behind Vlad Circus, the religious fanatics populating San Reno, and the fearsome Asmodeus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1567530/extras/9490bd9ee73813fc91ad3b855fc829f1.poster.avif?t=1756160890\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1567530/extras/9490bd9ee73813fc91ad3b855fc829f1.webm?t=1756160890\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1567530/extras/9490bd9ee73813fc91ad3b855fc829f1.mp4?t=1756160890\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An Unsettling Atmosphere</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a meticulously crafted pixel-art world where dynamic lighting and sound play a crucial role in creating an oppressive, claustrophobic atmosphere. The pixel-art style combines with modern effects to create a mesmerizing audiovisual experience that amplifies the sense of terror and disorientation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1567530/extras/34a5baf41c2a0fb516c8eabc4f85070c.poster.avif?t=1756160890\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1567530/extras/34a5baf41c2a0fb516c8eabc4f85070c.webm?t=1756160890\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1567530/extras/34a5baf41c2a0fb516c8eabc4f85070c.mp4?t=1756160890\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dare You Face Your Demons?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vlad Circus: Curse of Asmodeus is more than a game; it\u2019s a journey into the heart of tragedy and madness. Will you have the courage to confront your own demons as you fight to uncover the truth? Can you maintain your sanity as you venture into the darkest corners of the mind?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare for a macabre horror adventure that will challenge your perceptions and test your resolve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1567530/extras/58e6c3c34a2d31eac357cf90b4575729.poster.avif?t=1756160890\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1567530/extras/58e6c3c34a2d31eac357cf90b4575729.webm?t=1756160890\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1567530/extras/58e6c3c34a2d31eac357cf90b4575729.mp4?t=1756160890\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Lazarus","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1567530/819a03242e526062cb49f2bd14a13e6ed5c198b8.jpg"},{"name":"Reflections","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1567530/f543f6bae668f845f8792f7281e3fa25ba532ad3.jpg"},{"name":"Vlad Circus","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1567530/b6467f38634bc04ea3307e2a2d1cc88b0150cd4d.jpg"},{"name":"Brother","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1567530/a12f7b2c62111d6699996db553858bdea12b397a.jpg"},{"name":"Spread the Word","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1567530/857c6191cf990df89a8d381962588ebb623dc743.jpg"},{"name":"El Dorado","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1567530/ea11f781ac5e34437a69282b4b3950588709b8ce.jpg"},{"name":"Blancmange","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1567530/a717e99e84b611509447bae639e2c3215726871f.jpg"},{"name":"Lucky Stroke","path":"http